# Featured Projects

## TAlgo-X — Autonomous Trading Execution Platform
🌐 https://jvkrog.github.io/TAlgo-X-Website/

Production-grade trading infrastructure built around a **single deterministic execution brain** capable of operating multiple market instruments through isolated runtime contexts.

TAlgo-X combines a powerful **CLI operator toolkit** with a **real-time web dashboard**, enabling deployment, monitoring, and management of live trading engines from a unified platform.

```text
                    TAlgo-X
                        │
         ┌──────────────┴──────────────┐
         │                             │
    CLI Toolbox                Web Dashboard
         │                             │
         └──────────────┬──────────────┘
                        │
                 Runtime Orchestrator
                        │
        ┌───────────────┼───────────────┐
        │               │               │
     NatGas         Zinc          USDINR
     Context        Context        Context
        │               │               │
        └───────────────┼───────────────┘
                        │
               Deterministic Brain
                        │
        Market → Strategy → Risk → Orders
```

### Platform Features

#### Runtime
- One Brain multi-instrument architecture
- Context-driven execution
- Deterministic candle-driven runtime
- SQLite state persistence & recovery
- PM2 process lifecycle management
- Manual contract rollover
- Structured execution logging

#### Operator Interfaces

**CLI Toolbox**
- Engine deployment
- Instrument management
- Backtesting
- Runtime control
- Configuration management
- Live execution

**Web Dashboard**
- Live engine monitoring
- Runtime telemetry
- Position & PnL tracking
- Engine lifecycle management
- Real-time execution logs
- Browser-based operator console

#### Trading Infrastructure

- Market-state driven execution
- Multi-engine runtime
- Telegram notifications
- Explainable execution flow
- Strategy orchestration
- Production-ready deployment workflow

